  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Let&apos;s get ready to rebuild Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This madness will stop, eventually, and after that, we&apos;ll clean up, put the pieces back together and move on.  Over the last 15 years, we&apos;ve managed multiple construction crews here in Moldova, building the Eco-village complex, Katalyst Kitchens, and repairing houses and apartments for many friends and family.  We have a lot of experience, and contacts.  But what if you intersect that with our professional backgrounds in non-formal education?  Let us introduce the Katalyst Vocational School.</narrative>
  </description>
